Excel Analysis

Microsoft Excel was used for preliminary data exploration and business analysis, including:

1. Creating pivot tables to compare sales and profit across regions and product categories.

2. Calculating and comparing profit margins to identify differences in regional performance.

3. Examining category-level profitability across Furniture, Office Supplies, and Technology.

4. Exploring sales and profit patterns to identify areas requiring further investigation.

The Excel analysis supported the SQL investigation and helped inform the visual reporting developed in Power BI.
